Package: fitAQ
Title: Fitting Light Response Curves for Photosynthesis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jiedong", "Zhu", , "zhujiedong@yeah.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to fit four common light response models
    (rectangular hyperbola, non-rectangular hyperbola, exponential, and
    modified rectangular hyperbola) using differential evolution optimization
    (DEoptim). Calculates key physiological parameters such as light compensation
    point (LCP), light saturation point (LSP), maximum net photosynthetic rate
    (Pmax), apparent quantum yield (AQY), and dark respiration (Rd). Includes
    plotting methods and helper functions for extracting results.
